msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;Minimum temperature at which it will become spontaneous is&nbsp;<u>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</u>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>. (Integer)"}, "options": [{"id": "fbbc40", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f80c677dc36a8927409"}, {"id": "543950", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f80c677dc36a892740a"}, {"id": "e9467a", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f80c677dc36a892740b"}, {"id": "03d24e", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f80c677dc36a892740c"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f80c677dc36a892740d", "type": "numerical", "chapters": ["60c9e849ea076dc381c0df8c"], "topics": ["60e2fada66f9ce3f243b4783"], "concepts": ["60e2fad966f9ce3f243b473a"], "question": {"text": "The standard heat of formation <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><msubsup><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>298</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></math> of ethane (in <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mrow></math> ), if the heat of combustion of ethane, hydrogen and graphite are <math><mo>-</mo><mn>1560</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>393.5</mn></math> and <math><mo>-</mo><mn>286&#160;</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mrow></math> , respectively is ________"}, "options": [{"id": "92b45c", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f80c677dc36a892740e"}, {"id": "80c362", "text": "", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f80c677dc36a892740